# Build context for the Railway backend service (root directory: backend).
# Railpack honours this file. Everything listed is read only by offline
# import / training tools, never by the running server, and together it is
# ~700 MB that overflowed Railway's build disk (2026-11-03).
#
# Still shipped on purpose: fixtures/ (seed_question_bank, relink_fixture_images),
# Medura_Train/*.pdf at the top level (resources downloads) and
# Medura_Train/textbooks|web_knowledge/*.md (ingest_source internal-notes).

# Page images and intermediate output of the INI-CET / NEET PG importers
importers/*/_output/

# Question-paper PDFs and sources used by the import commands
pyq/
Medura_Train/PYQ/
Medura_Train/textbooks/**/*.pdf
Medura_Train/uploads/

# One-off backups and local databases (production uses DATABASE_URL)
questions_backup.json
db.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal

# Local tooling and secrets
.env
.env.*
venv/
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
